<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>Análisis de Producto — {{ result.niche }}</title>
<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: dark;
    --bg: #0a0e18; --bg-soft: #0d1322; --surface: #111a2e; --surface-2: #0e1626;
    --border: rgba(255,255,255,.08); --border-strong: rgba(255,255,255,.16);
    --text: #e7ecf7; --muted: #8b92a8; --muted-2: #5f6780;
    --accent: #2dd4ee; --accent-soft: rgba(45,212,238,.12);
    --gold: #eaa63e;
    --good: #34d399; --good-bg: rgba(52,211,153,.12);
    --warn: #eaa63e; --warn-bg: rgba(234,166,62,.12);
    --danger: #f27272; --danger-bg: rgba(242,114,114,.14);
    --tag-bg: rgba(255,255,255,.05); --tag-text: #b7bed2;
    --shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.5; }
  a { color: var(--accent); }
  code { background: var(--tag-bg); border-radius: 4px; padding: .05rem .35rem; font-size: .85em; }

  .topbar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .8rem; padding: 1rem 1.6rem; background: var(--bg-soft); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .logo { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 10px; flex: none; background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, var(--gold), #7a4e12); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.3rem; box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.08), 0 4px 12px rgba(234,166,62,.25); overflow: hidden; }
  .radar-sweep { transform-origin: 20px 20px; animation: radar-spin 3s linear infinite; }
  @keyframes radar-spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
  .brand-name { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
  .brand-sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: .78rem; }

  .niche-nav { display: flex; gap: .3rem; padding: .7rem 1.6rem; overflow-x: auto; background: var(--bg-soft); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); align-items: center; }
  .niche-tab { text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); padding: .45rem .9rem; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid transparent; }
  .niche-tab:hover { color: var(--text); background: var(--tag-bg); }
  .niche-tab.active { color: var(--bg); background: var(--accent); }
  .nav-cta { margin-left: auto; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--bg); background: var(--gold); padding: .45rem .9rem; border-radius: 999px; }

  .page-head { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.6rem 0; }
  .breadcrumb { color: var(--muted-2); font-size: .78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; margin: 0 0 .5rem; }
  .page-head h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin: 0 0 .3rem; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
  .page-head .subtitle { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 1.4rem; font-size: .92rem; }

  main { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.6rem 4rem; }
  .card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.3rem 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .card h2 { font-size: .82rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .05em; color: var(--muted-2); margin: 0 0 .9rem; }

  .verdict-card { border: 1px solid var(--border-strong); text-align: center; padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }
  .verdict-label { font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
  .verdict-label.alta { color: var(--good); }
  .verdict-label.media, .verdict-label.viable { color: var(--accent); }
  .verdict-label.baja { color: var(--danger); }
  .verdict-explanation { color: var(--muted); max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: .95rem; }

  .kv-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: .8rem; }
  .kv { background: var(--surface-2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: .8rem 1rem; }
  .kv .k { font-size: .72rem; color: var(--muted-2); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; margin-bottom: .25rem; }
  .kv .v { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .kv .v.small { font-size: .95rem; font-weight: 600; }

  .badge { display: inline-block; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 700; padding: .25rem .7rem; border-radius: 999px; }
  .badge.alta { background: var(--danger-bg); color: var(--danger); }
  .badge.media { background: var(--warn-bg); color: var(--warn); }
  .badge.baja { background: var(--good-bg); color: var(--good); }

  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: .86rem; }
  th { text-align: left; color: var(--muted-2); font-size: .72rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; padding: .5rem .6rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-strong); }
  td { padding: .55rem .6rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  .tag { background: var(--tag-bg); color: var(--tag-text); border-radius: 6px; padding: .1rem .5rem; font-size: .74rem; }
  .mega-flag { color: var(--warn); font-size: .74rem; }

  .warning-box { background: var(--warn-bg); border: 1px solid rgba(234,166,62,.35); border-radius: 10px; padding: .8rem 1rem; font-size: .85rem; color: #f0d6a8; margin-bottom: .6rem; }
  .warning-box:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  footer { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; color: var(--muted-2); font-size: .8rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="topbar">
  <div class="logo"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" width="22" height="22"><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="17" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" opacity=".3" fill="none"/><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="11" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" opacity=".45" fill="none"/><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" opacity=".6" fill="none"/><g class="radar-sweep"><path d="M20 20 L20 3 A17 17 0 0 1 34.7 11.5 Z" fill="url(#rs)"/></g><circle cx="27" cy="12" r="1.6" fill="#2dd4ee"/><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="1.4" fill="#201400"/><defs><linearGradient id="rs" x1="20" y1="20" x2="34.7" y2="11.5" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop stop-color="#fff" stop-opacity=".9"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#fff" stop-opacity="0"/></linearGradient></defs></svg></div>
  <div>
    <div class="brand-name">Radar de Ecommerce</div>
    <div class="brand-sub">Ecommerce Creative Intelligence · Análisis de Viabilidad de Producto</div>
  </div>
</header>

{% if all_niches %}
<nav class="niche-nav">
  {% for n in all_niches %}
  <a class="niche-tab{{ ' active' if n.active else '' }}" href="{{ n.href }}">{{ n.label }}</a>
  {% endfor %}
  {% if new_analysis_href %}<a class="nav-cta" href="{{ new_analysis_href }}">＋ Analizar otro producto</a>{% endif %}
</nav>
{% endif %}

<div class="page-head">
  <p class="breadcrumb">Radar de Ecommerce / {{ result.niche | title }} / Análisis de producto</p>
  <h1>{{ result.product_description }}</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">
    Nicho: {{ result.niche | title }}{% if result.subniche %} · Subnicho: {{ result.subniche }} (confianza {{ (result.subniche_confidence * 100) | round | int }}%){% endif %}
    · Mercados: {{ result.markets | join(' · ') }} · generado {{ generated_at[:10] }}
  </p>
</div>

<main>
  {% if result.warnings %}
  {% for w in result.warnings %}
  <div class="warning-box">⚠️ {{ w }}</div>
  {% endfor %}
  {% endif %}

  <div class="card verdict-card">
    <div class="verdict-label {{ 'baja' if 'Baja' in result.viability_label else ('alta' if 'Alta' in result.viability_label else 'media') }}">
      {{ result.viability_label }}
    </div>
    <p class="verdict-explanation">{{ result.viability_explanation }}</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Resumen</h2>
    <div class="kv-grid">
      <div class="kv"><div class="k">Competidores encontrados</div><div class="v">{{ result.total_competitors }}</div></div>
      <div class="kv"><div class="k">Nivel de saturación</div><div class="v small"><span class="badge {{ result.saturation_level | lower }}">{{ result.saturation_level }}</span></div></div>
      <div class="kv"><div class="k">Escala alta (50+ anuncios)</div><div class="v">{{ result.scale_alta_count }}</div></div>
      <div class="kv"><div class="k">Marcas grandes / marketplaces</div><div class="v">{{ result.mega_brand_competitors }}</div></div>
      {% if result.margin_pct is not none %}
      <div class="kv"><div class="k">Margen estimado</div><div class="v">{{ result.margin_pct }}%</div></div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if result.price_position %}
      <div class="kv"><div class="k">Posición de precio</div><div class="v small">{{ result.price_position }}</div></div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>

  {% if result.cost_price is not none or result.target_price is not none %}
  <div class="card">
    <h2>Precio y margen</h2>
    <div class="kv-grid">
      {% if result.cost_price is not none %}<div class="kv"><div class="k">Costo</div><div class="v">{{ result.cost_price }}</div></div>{% endif %}
      {% if result.target_price is not none %}<div class="kv"><div class="k">Precio de venta objetivo</div><div class="v">{{ result.target_price }}</div></div>{% endif %}
      {% if result.margin_label %}<div class="kv"><div class="k">Lectura del margen</div><div class="v small">{{ result.margin_label }}</div></div>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:.8rem; margin-top:.8rem; margin-bottom:0;">{{ result.currency_note }}</p>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if result.market_price_samples %}
  <div class="card">
    <h2>Rango de precios de la competencia (extraído del copy de sus anuncios reales)</h2>
    <div class="kv-grid">
      <div class="kv"><div class="k">Mínimo observado</div><div class="v">{{ result.market_price_min }}</div></div>
      <div class="kv"><div class="k">Mediana</div><div class="v">{{ result.market_price_median }}</div></div>
      <div class="kv"><div class="k">Máximo observado</div><div class="v">{{ result.market_price_max }}</div></div>
      <div class="kv"><div class="k">Muestras encontradas</div><div class="v">{{ result.market_price_samples | length }}</div></div>
    </div>
    <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:.8rem; margin-top:.8rem; margin-bottom:0;">
      Extraído por texto de los anuncios activos de la competencia — no siempre el precio aparece en el copy, así que es una muestra parcial, no un catálogo completo.
    </p>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if result.top_competitors %}
  <div class="card">
    <h2>Principales competidores encontrados</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Marca</th><th>Mercado</th><th>Anuncios activos</th><th>Escala</th><th>Tienda</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for c in result.top_competitors %}
        <tr>
          <td>{{ c.page_name }}{% if c.is_mega_brand %} <span class="mega-flag">⚠ marca grande / marketplace</span>{% endif %}</td>
          <td>{{ c.market }}</td>
          <td>{{ c.active_ad_count }}</td>
          <td><span class="tag">{{ c.scale_tier }}</span></td>
          <td>{% if c.store_url %}<a href="{{ c.store_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ver tienda ↗</a>{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</main>

<footer>
  Análisis generado desde datos ya investigados en Meta Ad Library · Ecommerce Creative Intelligence ·
  Señal de presencia publicitaria y precios de copy público, no de ventas ni rentabilidad reales del competidor.
</footer>
</body>
</html>
